WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.712
Open the menu beside Full Text and choose Add Chapter.

2
00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:10.113
Edit the heading to name your chapter.

3
00:00:10.113 --> 00:00:16.614
Write in the manuscript. Wait for Saved.

4
00:00:16.614 --> 00:00:19.880
Reopen the page: the chapter and its words remain.
